ance"},{"text":"Analyze sensor data"},{"text":"Build predictive-maintenance prototypes"},{"text":"Use Python for engineering analytics"},{"text":"Understand railway safety and testing"},{"text":"Communicate effectively with mechanical, electrical, software and operations teams"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate portfolio should contain 5–7 substantial railway engineering projects."},{"type":"h","text":"1. Railway Bogie Design"},{"type":"p","text":"CAD + FEA of a bogie component with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stress analysis"},{"text":"Fatigue"},{"text":"Weight optimization"},{"text":"Engineering drawings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Vehicle Dynamics Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Model:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Carbody","Bogie","Suspension","Wheelset"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"and analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ride comfort"},{"text":"Stability"},{"text":"Curving"},{"text":"Track irregularities"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Railway Braking Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Model:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brake command"},{"text":"Brake force"},{"text":"Deceleration"},{"text":"Wheel-slide protection concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Predictive Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bearing vibration"},{"text":"Wheel condition"},{"text":"Motor temperature"},{"text":"Brake temperature"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Regenerative Braking"},{"type":"p","text":"Calculate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Kinetic energy"},{"text":"Braking energy"},{"text":"Recovered energy"},{"text":"Storage/grid utilization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. TCMS Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simplified system connecting:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sensors","Vehicle Controllers","TCMS","Traction"]},{"type":"p","text":"Brake"},{"type":"p","text":"Doors"},{"type":"p","text":"HVAC"},{"type":"p","text":"Diagnostics"},{"type":"h","text":"7. Digital Twin of Rolling Stock"},{